Yeah, that was the one where I was like, does the news van just pull up in front of our apartment?
是的，当时我就想，新闻车就停在我们公寓前面了吗？

00:34:17.110 --> 00:34:18.190
There you are.
你就在那里。

00:34:18.190 --> 00:34:20.949
We've been looking for you.
我们一直在找你。

00:34:20.949 --> 00:34:22.030
Where have they been looking?
他们一直在寻找什么？

