He'll has a destiny of some sort like it's gonna right but the from the perspective of the molecule It doesn't know that yeah, and I always thought that was kind of like how I made him other like Ted was the molecule Getting knocked around inside the cell But then older Ted was kind of the scientist who's like no no I see how this is all coalescing and yes and gathering steam and and making sense, you know, yeah I think like that's destiny in the world of the show to me is like the gratitude you feel for for your life looking back and realizing that even the hard parts had to happen and they made you who you are and you survived them and you became who you are now and you're happy to be.
他会有某种命运，就像它会是正确的，但从分子的角度来看，它不知道，是的，我一直认为这有点像我如何让他像泰德一样，是分子在细胞内被撞倒，但年长的泰德是一位科学家，他就像不不，我明白这一切是如何凝聚在一起的，是的，聚集蒸汽，并有意义，你知道，是的，我认为这就是节目世界中的命运对我来说就像感激你感受你的生活，回顾过去，意识到即使是困难的部分也必须发生，它们造就了现在的你，你熬过了它们，你成为了现在的你，你很高兴成为这样的人。

